      "Language": "fre",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "This literature review compares the endodontic treatment in one or more appointments on the healing of periapical lesions and the occurrence of postoperative pain and flare-ups. It turns out that the root canal treatment completed in one session has many advantages and may he considered the prime option in the majority of clinical cases."},
